title: "Aniultimatium: English sub and dub anime app for Samsung Tizen TVs"
abstract: "Free, open-source anime streaming app for Samsung Tizen smart TVs (Tizen 4.0+) with English subtitles, English dub, remote-first controls, adaptive source ranking (SourceIQ), fast source discovery (TurboScrape) and AniList sync."
